.TH SIGMA-SH 1 "May 2024" "SigmaOS 0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sigma-sh \- Zero-dependency, capability-secured POSIX-like shell for SigmaOS
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sigma-sh
[\fIOPTION\fR]... [\fIFILE\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sigma-sh
is the native interactive command shell and scripting interpreter for SigmaOS.
It operates in Ring 3 with zero dynamic C-library dependencies, providing built-in
capability gating, history logging, and AST-level pre-compiled evaluation.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-c \ \fIcommand\fR
Execute \fIcommand\fR string and exit.
.TP
.BR \-i
Interactive shell mode.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Output version information and exit.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sigma-pkg (1)
